# Prompt 2 — Jac Schema, Policy, Colors, Main Bootstrap

## Objective
Populate the Jac schema layer: node archetypes, edge archetypes, the policy glob, the color helpers, and the main.jac bootstrap.

## Prerequisites
Prompt 1 complete.

## Files to Modify
jac/schemas/nodes.jac, jac/schemas/edges.jac, jac/lib/policy.jac, jac/lib/colors.jac, jac/main.jac.

## jac/schemas/nodes.jac — write verbatim
node Asset { has :pub id: str; has :pub name: str; has :pub symbol: str; has :pub chain: str; has :pub token_address: str; has :pub overall_status: str = "unknown"; has :pub created_at: int; }
node PriceObservation { has :pub value: float; has :pub timestamp: int; has :pub source: str; has :pub provenance: str; has :pub round_id: int = 0; }
node ReserveAttestation { has :pub amount: float; has :pub timestamp: int; has :pub source: str; has :pub provenance: str; has :pub feed_address: str; has :pub round_id: int = 0; has :pub answered_in_round: int = 0; }
node ChildClaim { has :pub asset_id: str; has :pub amount: float; has :pub timestamp: int; has :pub source: str; has :pub present: bool; has :pub provenance: str; }
node Liability { has :pub minted_units: float; has :pub vault_shares: float; has :pub demo_position: float; has :pub description: str; }
node Stamp { has :pub walker_name: str; has :pub color: str; has :pub reasons: list[str]; has :pub timestamp: int; has :pub payload: dict = {}; }
node MintRecord { has :pub tx_hash: str; has :pub token_address: str; has :pub nft_token_id: int; has :pub minted_amount: float; has :pub coverage_used: float; has :pub price_time: int; has :pub reserve_time: int; has :pub stamp_summary: dict; has :pub timestamp: int; }

## jac/schemas/edges.jac — write verbatim
edge HasPrice {} edge HasReserve {} edge DependsOn {} edge HasLiability {} edge StampedBy {} edge MintedAs {}

## jac/lib/policy.jac — write verbatim
glob POLICY = { "max_price_age_seconds": 300, "max_reserve_age_seconds": 3600, "min_coverage_ratio": 1.00, "coverage_floor_ratio": 0.95, "flat_reserve_epsilon": 0.001, "flat_reserve_windows": 3, "price_move_epsilon": 0.005, "child_max_age_seconds": 3600, "colors": { "green": "pass", "yellow": "caution_blocks_printer", "red": "fail", "unknown": "missing_fact_halt" } };

## jac/lib/colors.jac
glob COLOR_GREEN = "green"; glob COLOR_YELLOW = "yellow"; glob COLOR_RED = "red"; glob COLOR_UNKNOWN = "unknown"; can color_rank(c: str) -> int { if c == COLOR_GREEN { return 0; } if c == COLOR_YELLOW { return 1; } if c == COLOR_RED { return 2; } return 3; } can min_color(a: str, b: str) -> str { if color_rank(a) >= color_rank(b) { return a; } return b; }

## jac/main.jac
import from schemas.nodes { Asset, PriceObservation, ReserveAttestation, ChildClaim, Liability, Stamp, MintRecord }
import from schemas.edges { HasPrice, HasReserve, DependsOn, HasLiability, StampedBy, MintedAs }
import from lib.policy { POLICY }
import from lib.colors { COLOR_GREEN, COLOR_YELLOW, COLOR_RED, COLOR_UNKNOWN, color_rank, min_color }
with entry { print("PoRJE graph booted. Policy:", POLICY); }
Walker imports will be added in Prompts 5–8.

## Agent Grounding — Jac 0.7.0+ Syntax
Node declaration: node Name { has field: type; } — braces, typed has fields. Edge declaration: edge Name {} — braces. Node creation: Asset(id="x", name="X", symbol="X", chain="sepolia", token_address="0x0", created_at=0). Typed edge creation: source +>: HasPrice() :+> target;. Generic edge creation: source ++> target;. Forward traversal by typed edge: [here ->:HasPrice:->]. Backward traversal by typed edge: [here <-:DependsOn:-<]. All forward edges: [here -->]. Type-filtered: [here -->](`?Person). FORBIDDEN legacy syntax: -[HasPrice]->, -->:HasPrice:-->, here -> HasPrice ->, visit -[HasPrice]->.

## Acceptance Criteria
1. All five files populated. 2. main.jac parses without errors when walker imports absent. 3. POLICY importable. 4. min_color("green","yellow") == "yellow" and min_color("yellow","red") == "red".

## Do NOT
Do not implement any walker. Do not import walkers into main.jac yet. Do not add fields to nodes beyond specified — the frontend TS types in Prompt 11 depend on exact names.
